& \Rightarrow \frac{s-b}{s-a}=\frac{3}{2} \Rightarrow s=3 a-2 b \quad ...\mathrm{(iv)} \end{aligned}$<br/>Divide (ii) by (iii), we get
$\begin{aligned}
