\end{aligned}=\frac{10}{6}\begin{aligned} & \Rightarrow 5 b-3 c=25 \Rightarrow 5 b-3 c=a+b+c \\ & \Rightarrow 4 b-4 c=9 \Rightarrow \frac{a}{b-c}=4\end{aligned}$

